	 */</span>
	<span class="keyword">function</span> <span class="twoslash-hover"><span class="twoslash-target"><span class="function">add</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover" aria-hidden="true"><span class="twoslash-popover-type"><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="identifier">local</span> <span class="keyword">function</span><span class="punctuation">)</span> <span class="function">add</span><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="parameter">a</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="type">number</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="parameter">b</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="type">number</span><span class="punctuation">):</span> <span class="type">number</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover-docs">Adds two numbers. **Bold** &amp; &quot;quoted&quot;.</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tags"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="param"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag-name">a</span> the first operand</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="param"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag-name">b</span> the second operand</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="returns">the sum</span></span></span></span><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="twoslash-hover"><span class="twoslash-target"><span class="parameter">a</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover" aria-hidden="true"><span class="twoslash-popover-type"><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="identifier">parameter</span><span class="punctuation">)</span> <span class="identifier">a</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="type">number</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover-docs">the first operand</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tags"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="param"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag-name">a</span> the first operand</span></span></span></span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="identifier">number</span><span class="punctuation">,</span> <span class="twoslash-hover"><span class="twoslash-target"><span class="parameter">b</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover" aria-hidden="true"><span class="twoslash-popover-type"><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="identifier">parameter</span><span class="punctuation">)</span> <span class="identifier">b</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="type">number</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover-docs">the second operand</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tags"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="param"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag-name">b</span> the second operand</span></span></span></span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="identifier">number</span><span class="punctuation">)</span> <span class="punctuation">{</span>
		<span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="twoslash-hover"><span class="twoslash-target"><span class="identifier">a</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover" aria-hidden="true"><span class="twoslash-popover-type"><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="identifier">parameter</span><span class="punctuation">)</span> <span class="identifier">a</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="type">number</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover-docs">the first operand</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tags"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="param"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag-name">a</span> the first operand</span></span></span></span> <span class="operator">+</span> <span class="twoslash-hover"><span class="twoslash-target"><span class="identifier">b</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover" aria-hidden="true"><span class="twoslash-popover-type"><span class="punctuation">(</span><span class="identifier">parameter</span><span class="punctuation">)</span> <span class="identifier">b</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="type">number</span></span><span class="twoslash-popover-docs">the second operand</span><span class="twoslash-popover-tags"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag" data-tag="param"><span class="twoslash-popover-tag-name">b</span> the second operand</span></span></span></span><span class="punctuation">;</span>
	<span class="punctuation">}</span>
<span class="punctuation">&lt;/</span><span class="tag_name">script</span><span class="punctuation">&gt;</span>
</code></pre>"
